@title Cabinet: a new plate size resizes the rails and ducts (plate follow)
@area Cabinet
# qa/fixtures/plate-follow-rail.novo (built by write_plate_follow_fixtures): a 600 x 800 mm plate with two rails across its whole width and a duct down its whole height. Plate setup to 750 x 950 mm: the rails and the duct follow, with a message, and one undo restores both.
open qa/fixtures/plate-follow-rail.novo
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 20
shot plate-600x800
click_text "Plate setup"
wait 10
shot plate-setup-card
# The width in the inspector: the rail follows, the message says so.
click_text "600" SpinButton
wait 4
key ctrl+a
text 750
key Enter
wait 6
expect "that ran across the old plate"
shot width-750-message
check_layout
# The height: the duct follows.
wait 120
click_text "800" SpinButton
wait 4
key ctrl+a
text 950
key Enter
wait 6
expect "that ran across the old plate"
shot height-950-message
check_layout
wait 30
# Close the inspector card to see the rails and the duct spanning the new plate.
click_text "Plate setup"
wait 10
shot plate-750x950
check_layout
# One undo puts the plate and the rail back.
key ctrl+z
wait 10
shot undo-height
